{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-management-optimization","title":"可观测性成本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/culture-operations/cost-management-optimization","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测性成本管理\">可观测性成本管理</h1><p>可观测性数据的增长速度远超业务增长。一个 200 个微服务的组织每天产生的遥测数据量轻松达到 TB 级——存储成本、网络传输成本、查询计算成本加总后，可观测性常常成为云账单中仅次于计算和存储的第三大开支。2026 年 CNCF 调查显示，企业平均将 IT 预算的 15–20% 投入可观测性，且增长率每年 25%+。成本不控制的后果不是&quot;多花了钱&quot;，而是&quot;团队不敢采集数据&quot;——最终反而削弱了可观测性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>成本管理的基本术语决定了“钱花在哪、谁来花、如何约束”：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在治理中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采集成本</td>\n<td>Agent/Collector 的 CPU + 内存</td>\n<td>可被采样率与客户端过滤削减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输成本</td>\n<td>数据量 × 网络单价</td>\n<td>压缩（gzip/OTel-Arrow）战场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储成本</td>\n<td>数据量 × 保留时间 × 介质</td>\n<td>分层存储与降采样的对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询成本</td>\n<td>扫描数据量 × 查询频率</td>\n<td>索引与预聚合优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Showback</td>\n<td>向团队展示其成本</td>\n<td>成本治理的起步阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chargeback</td>\n<td>从团队预算中扣除</td>\n<td>成熟阶段的强约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基数预算</td>\n<td>每服务允许的最大时序数</td>\n<td>防止标签爆炸的硬闸门</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>隐私与成本由设计决定，而非事后补救</strong>——同理，成本优化的前提是知道谁在花钱。没有归因的优化只能靠猜，而 Showback 用“看见”本身就能显著降低浪费。核心洞察是：日志通常占总成本的 40–55%，因为它默认全量采集且缺乏结构化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本构成解析\">成本构成解析</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>采集成本</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>传输成本</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>存储成本</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>查询成本</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>人力成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总成本} = \\text{采集成本} + \\text{传输成本} + \\text{存储成本} + \\text{查询成本} + \\text{人力成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">采集成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传输成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">存储成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">查询成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">人力成本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>驱动因素</th>\n<th>优化杠杆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采集</td>\n<td>Agent/Collector 的 CPU + 内存</td>\n<td>采样率、客户端过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输</td>\n<td>数据量 × 网络单价</td>\n<td>压缩（gzip/OTel-Arrow）、本地聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>数据量 × 保留时间 × 存储介质</td>\n<td>分层存储、降采样、TTL 策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询</td>\n<td>扫描数据量 × 查询频率</td>\n<td>索引优化、预聚合、查询限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人力</td>\n<td>平台团队维护可观测性基础设施</td>\n<td>自服务平台、标准化配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"按信号类型的成本特征\">按信号类型的成本特征</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>单条大小</th>\n<th>基数/volume 特征</th>\n<th>存储效率</th>\n<th>成本占比（典型）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Metrics</td>\n<td>~100 bytes/sample</td>\n<td>低（聚合后）；危险是标签基数爆炸</td>\n<td>极高（压缩好）</td>\n<td>15–25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Logs</td>\n<td>~500B–5KB/条</td>\n<td>极高（全量未采样）</td>\n<td>中（可压缩）</td>\n<td>40–55%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traces</td>\n<td>~1KB/span</td>\n<td>中（采样后）；spike 时可暴涨</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>20–35%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Profiles</td>\n<td>~200B/sample</td>\n<td>中（固定频率采样）</td>\n<td>高（去重栈帧）</td>\n<td>5–10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>核心洞察：日志通常占总成本的 40–55%。</strong> 这是因为日志默认全量采集且缺乏结构化——相比之下 metrics 经过聚合后体积极小，traces 至少有采样机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本优化策略矩阵\">成本优化策略矩阵</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 四象限优化&#10;        A[高价值 + 高成本&lt;br/&gt;保留,优化效率] --&gt; O{优化目标}&#10;        B[高价值 + 低成本&lt;br/&gt;保持现状] --&gt; O&#10;        C[低价值 + 高成本&lt;br/&gt;立即削减] --&gt; O&#10;        D[低价值 + 低成本&lt;br/&gt;低优先级] --&gt; O&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 四象限优化\n        A[高价值 + 高成本&lt;br/&gt;保留,优化效率] --&gt; O{优化目标}\n        B[高价值 + 低成本&lt;br/&gt;保持现状] --&gt; O\n        C[低价值 + 高成本&lt;br/&gt;立即削减] --&gt; O\n        D[低价值 + 低成本&lt;br/&gt;低优先级] --&gt; O\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"策略一-采样与过滤-减少数据产生\">策略一：采样与过滤（减少数据产生）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Head Sampling</td>\n<td>Traces</td>\n<td>线性降低量</td>\n<td>丢失有价值的异常 trace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tail Sampling</td>\n<td>Traces</td>\n<td>只保留有价值的 trace</td>\n<td>需要 Gateway 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志级别过滤</td>\n<td>Logs</td>\n<td>DEBUG/INFO 不发送</td>\n<td>事后排障可能缺少上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metric 标签裁剪</td>\n<td>Metrics</td>\n<td>降低时序数</td>\n<td>失去切分维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态采样</td>\n<td>All</td>\n<td>按流量/SLA 自适应</td>\n<td>实现复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"策略二-压缩与编码-减少传输和存储体积\">策略二：压缩与编码（减少传输和存储体积）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>gzip/zstd 传输压缩</td>\n<td>5:1–10:1</td>\n<td>OTLP export</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTel-Arrow 协议</td>\n<td>55–70% 带宽节省</td>\n<td>高吞吐 Collector 间传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志结构化</td>\n<td>减少重复文本</td>\n<td>JSON 替代自由文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metric delta 编码</td>\n<td>TSDB 原生支持</td>\n<td>长保留 metric 存储</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"策略三-分层存储与保留策略\">策略三：分层存储与保留策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>存储介质</th>\n<th>保留时间</th>\n<th>查询延迟</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hot</td>\n<td>SSD / 内存</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>&lt; 1s</td>\n<td>实时排障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warm</td>\n<td>HDD / 对象存储（频繁访问）</td>\n<td>30 天</td>\n<td>1–10s</td>\n<td>趋势分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cold</td>\n<td>对象存储（归档）</td>\n<td>1–2 年</td>\n<td>10–60s</td>\n<td>合规审计、长期趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deleted</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>超过保留期自动清理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Metrics 推荐策略</strong>：原始分辨率保留 7 天 → 5 分钟降采样保留 30 天 → 1 小时降采样保留 2 年</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略四-管道内聚合-减少存储写入\">策略四：管道内聚合（减少存储写入）</h3><p>在 OTel Collector 中做聚合，将高频原始数据转换为低频聚合数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  # 将 trace span 聚合为 RED 指标（少量时序替代大量 span）&#10;  # 通过 spanmetrics connector 实现&#10;&#10;  # 日志聚合：相同模板的日志合并计数&#10;  groupbyattrs:&#10;    keys: [log.template, service.name, severity]&#10;&#10;  # Metric 降采样&#10;  metricstransform:&#10;    transforms:&#10;      - include: &#39;.*&#39;&#10;        match_type: regexp&#10;        action: update&#10;        operations:&#10;          - action: aggregate_labels&#10;            aggregation_type: sum&#10;            label_set: [service, method, status] # 只保留关键标签\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 将 trace span 聚合为 RED 指标（少量时序替代大量 span）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 通过 spanmetrics connector 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 日志聚合：相同模板的日志合并计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  groupbyattrs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">log.template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service.name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Metric 降采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  metricstransform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    transforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">include</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        match_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">regexp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        operations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aggregate_labels</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            aggregation_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            label_set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只保留关键标签</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"成本归因与-showback\">成本归因与 Showback</h2><p>成本优化的前提是<strong>知道谁在花钱</strong>。按团队/服务/信号类型做成本归因：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>团队成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mtext>service</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mtext>team</mtext></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>metric 时序数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单价</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>log volume</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单价</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>trace span 数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单价</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{团队成本} = \\sum_{\\text{service} \\in \\text{team}} (\\text{metric 时序数} \\times \\text{单价} + \\text{log volume} \\times \\text{单价} + \\text{trace span 数} \\times \\text{单价})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">团队成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3609em;vertical-align:-1.3109em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8665em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">service</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">team</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3109em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">metric </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时序数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">log volume</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">trace span </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单价</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归因维度</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按服务</td>\n<td>OTel Resource 的 <code>service.name</code> 标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按团队</td>\n<td><code>service.name</code> → team 映射表（CMDB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按信号类型</td>\n<td>Collector 的 export 统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按环境</td>\n<td><code>deployment.environment</code> 区分 prod/staging/dev</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Showback（展示成本） vs Chargeback（收费）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>起步阶段用 Showback——每月向团队展示其可观测性成本，提升成本意识</li>\n<li>成熟阶段可选 Chargeback——从团队预算中扣除，形成真正的约束力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"成本治理的组织机制\">成本治理的组织机制</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Metric 基数预算</td>\n<td>每服务允许最大 N 条时序</td>\n<td>防止标签爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Log volume 配额</td>\n<td>每服务每天 X GB</td>\n<td>倒逼结构化 + 级别控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样率自助调整</td>\n<td>团队自行设置 trace 采样率</td>\n<td>自主权 + 成本意识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月度成本 Review</td>\n<td>展示 Top 10 成本增长服务</td>\n<td>识别异常增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unused metric 清理</td>\n<td>30 天无查询的 metric 告警</td>\n<td>消除&quot;僵尸&quot;数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"roi-衡量\">ROI 衡量</h2><p>可观测性不是纯成本——它通过缩短 MTTR、减少事故影响来创造价值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>MTTR 缩短带来的收入保护</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>可观测性年度成本</mtext></mrow><mtext>可观测性年度成本</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI} = \\frac{\\text{MTTR 缩短带来的收入保护} - \\text{可观测性年度成本}}{\\text{可观测性年度成本}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可观测性年度成本</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTTR </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缩短带来的收入保护</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可观测性年度成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以电商为例：平均每分钟宕机损失 $5,000，年均 50 次事故。若可观测性将平均 MTTR 从 60min 降至 15min：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>年度收入保护：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5,000 × 45min × 50 =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span>11.25M</li>\n<li>可观测性年度成本：$2M</li>\n<li>ROI = 462%</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于事故中可观测性如何缩短 MTTR 的具体路径，参见 <a href=\"incident-observability\">事故中的可观测性</a>。团队可观测性实践的整体评估框架，参见 <a href=\"observability-maturity-model\">可观测性成熟度模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>可观测性成本管理的核心是让增长从“失控”回到“可控”。总成本由采集、传输、存储、查询、人力五项构成，其中日志通常占 40–55%，是最大的优化杠杆。四条策略按优先级排列：采样与过滤减少数据产生、压缩与编码减少传输存储体积、分层存储与降采样平衡成本与可查性、管道内聚合用少量时序替代大量原始数据。成本治理的前提是归因——起步用 Showback 建立成本意识，成熟后用 Chargeback 形成约束；配套的机制包括基数预算、日志配额与僵尸数据清理。最终用 ROI 衡量：可观测性不是纯成本，它通过缩短 MTTR 保护收入。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可观测性成本管理","id":"可观测性成本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本构成解析","id":"成本构成解析"},{"level":2,"text":"按信号类型的成本特征","id":"按信号类型的成本特征"},{"level":2,"text":"成本优化策略矩阵","id":"成本优化策略矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"策略一：采样与过滤（减少数据产生）","id":"策略一-采样与过滤-减少数据产生"},{"level":3,"text":"策略二：压缩与编码（减少传输和存储体积）","id":"策略二-压缩与编码-减少传输和存储体积"},{"level":3,"text":"策略三：分层存储与保留策略","id":"策略三-分层存储与保留策略"},{"level":3,"text":"策略四：管道内聚合（减少存储写入）","id":"策略四-管道内聚合-减少存储写入"},{"level":2,"text":"成本归因与 Showback","id":"成本归因与-showback"},{"level":2,"text":"成本治理的组织机制","id":"成本治理的组织机制"},{"level":2,"text":"ROI 衡量","id":"roi-衡量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事故中的可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/culture-operations/incident-observability"},"next":{"title":"可观测性成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/culture-operations/observability-maturity-model"}}